# SMS trace route. Inject NES Start separately with --pause-at-frame 600.
# Deep Stage-1 traversal v2: hold Right, periodic jump (A) and whip (B) pulses,
# plus Up-hold windows every 40 frames from f6550 (stairs at the page-13 wall).
# Frames are trace-sms injection frames (60K steps each).
# Prefix through f6508 is identical to stage1-traverse.sms.buttons (v1).
